invariant: INV-16
file: handshake_post.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes
reason: handshake_post.c binds a received ticket with 0 in place of the
  session's ch_cfg.cpu, so the binding's HMAC runs on the portable code
  whatever the caller states (docs/decisions.md 132).
  test/webpki_loop_runtime.h reads the value the binding took and
  objects.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_binding(CH_CFG_CPU(t->cfg), ticket.psk, ticket.psk_len, t->ticket_config_hash,
--- new
    webpki_ticket_binding(0, ticket.psk, ticket.psk_len, t->ticket_config_hash,
